s the only way to prevent people from \"cutting each other's throats\" over religious differences.\nHe argued that Y were the primary fuel for communal fires.\nHe noted that Y provoked just to increase business, essentially trading human lives for profit. He called them \"the real criminals\" behind the X.\nId X and Y", "role": "hint", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-23T19:23:01Z", "username": "Abhishek S", "text": "Secularism?", "role": "attempt", "is_correct": false, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-23T19:23:13Z", "username": "Abhishek S", "text": "Politicians for Y?", "role": "attempt", "is_correct": true, "has_media": false, "media": null}]